<title>UK: Merrill Lynch warrants on Credit Suisse.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch warrants on Credit Suisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued five million American-style call warrants on Credit Suisse Group.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    150.00 CHF		PREMIUM	11.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.15 CHF		  GEARING	13.30 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.FEB.97-17.APR.98   PAYDATE	13.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  144.00 CHF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
